A '''Magma Urchin Bundle''' is a {{Legendary}} consumable. It is unlocked from the [[Raffle of the Century]] during Year 500.

== Obtaining ==
A '''Magma Urchin Bundle''' is a {{Gold|'''MEDIUM'''}} reward from the Year 500 [[Raffle of the Century]].

== Usage ==
Consuming a '''Magma Urchin Bundle''' rewards the player with {{Item|Magma Urchin|amount=9}}. The following message also displays:
{{Dialogue|&d&lWOW! &eYou opened the bundle and found &a9x &5Magma Urchin &einside!}}

Additionally, a hurt sound plays and the player takes damage. Despite this, the player does not lose any {{Stat|HP}}.

== Trivia ==
* Despite giving {{Item|Magma Urchin|amount=9}}, the sprite only has {{Green|8}}.

